   1|#!/usr/bin/env python3
   2|"""S4POST Stage B: build the deterministic, fail-closed public Skills-only plugin candidate.
   3|
   4|This tool turns the eight ``skills/pipd-*`` packs into ONE portable plugin ZIP. It is
   5|fail-closed by construction: every owner-gated input that has not been supplied yet makes the build
   6|REFUSE with a typed reason (non-zero exit), never warn. Nothing here publishes anything; the output
   7|is a *candidate* whose receipt says ``claim_ceiling: LOCAL_PACKAGER_PASS_ONLY`` and
   8|``official_portal_verification: NOT_EXECUTED``.
   9|
  10|Owner-gated inputs (all missing on purpose in the checked-in candidate):
  11|  * a per-skill derivation record in ``derivations.json`` whose ``source_sha256`` matches the
  12|    frozen ledger (each ``SKILL.md`` carries non-portable frontmatter, so a byte-copy projection is
  13|    impossible and every skill needs an owner-approved derivation),
  14|  * the pinned official-schema digest (``official_schema_sha256`` must equal the sha256 of the local
  15|    ``plugin.schema.json`` subset),
  16|  * the publisher identity,
  17|  * the icon digests.
  18|
  19|Determinism: fixed ZIP metadata (1980-01-01, mode 0644, DEFLATED level 9). The archive is written
  20|to a scratch file, read back and compared member-by-member before it is promoted into place, so two
  21|builds from the same inputs are byte-identical.
  22|
  23|CLI
  24|---
  25|``--source-root DIR``     frozen checkout (default: the repository of this file)
  26|``--ledger FILE``         frozen source ledger from ``freeze_public_plugin_source.py``
  27|``--source-commit HEX40`` the pinned source commit (must equal the ledger commit)
  28|``--packaging-root DIR``  authoring directory (default: <repo>/packaging/public-plugin)
  29|``--out-dir DIR``         release directory for the candidate ZIP (must not overlap the repo)
  30|``--generate-icons``      (re)write the deterministic PNG icons into the packaging assets first
  31|"""
  32|from __future__ import annotations
  33|
  34|import argparse
  35|import hashlib
  36|import json
  37|import os
  38|import re
