+Typed refusals added by the vendor-schema lock: ``VENDOR_SCHEMA_MISSING``, ``VENDOR_SCHEMA_INVALID``,
+``VENDOR_SCHEMA_ID_MISMATCH``, ``OFFICIAL_SCHEMA_ID_MISMATCH``, ``VENDOR_SCHEMA_DIGEST_MISMATCH``,
